  "system": {
    "identifier": "serpent-fang-double",
    "description": "<p>You enter a low striking stance showing your overwhelming focus and precision as you disable your opponent with surgical accuracy. Make two melee taijutsu attacks dealing your [Unarmed damage] + 1d8. A creature who is hit by at least one of these attacks, must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save they gain +1 rank of Weakened.</p>\n<p>Finisher: If you score two hits on the target, they must make a Constitution saving throw, gaining +2 rank of Weakened on a failed save.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above D-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8</p>\n<p>.</p>",
